# ipsec-pq-mlkem-proposal-r2-hub.diff
#
# What ipsec-pq-mlkem.yml adds to the IKEv2 proposal on the hub. One line, and it is the whole unit.
#
# command: show running-config | section crypto ikev2 proposal
# router:  first block in the file

--- BEFORE: without the unit (state after teardown)   [phaseC/r2-mlkem-teardown.txt]
+++ AFTER:  with the unit applied   [phaseC/r2-mlkem-applied.txt]
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 crypto ikev2 proposal LAB-PROPOSAL 
+ pqc mlkem768 optional
  encryption aes-cbc-256
  integrity sha512
  group 20
